message: "If you use SignalOps in your research or projects, please cite it."
title: "SignalOps: Application Log Intelligence Platform"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Kumar"
    given-names: "Siddharth"

abstract: >-
  SignalOps is an AI-powered web application for application log
  intelligence and operational analysis. It helps developers
  understand application behavior, identify operational issues,
  and investigate incidents by transforming raw application logs
  into structured semantic events.

  Through a structured processing pipeline, SignalOps performs
  semantic parsing, signal detection, and incident correlation
  to organize related events into meaningful operational incidents.
  It also integrates AI-assisted analysis using Amazon Bedrock
  to provide contextual insights that support troubleshooting
  and incident investigation.

license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/siddharthk8/SignalOps"
